# No service in this repo currently builds from the repo root as its
# Docker context (docker-compose.yaml's 4 build stanzas all scope to a
# subdirectory: ./pgbouncer, ./services/alarm-api,
# ./services/factory-twin-3d, ./nodered_data -- each of those needs its
# OWN .dockerignore in that subdirectory to actually take effect; see
# services/factory-twin-3d/.dockerignore for the one that matters today).
# This file is forward-looking defense-in-depth for any future
# root-context build, so confidential facility data is excluded from a
# Docker build context by default rather than by remembering to add it
# later.
Apex3Layout/
private/
**/private/
**/*Apex3*
**/*APEX3*
*.dwg
*.dxf
*.ifc
*.step
*.stp
*.cad
node_modules/
